{"3989790":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Cranked","steam_appid":3989790,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cranked is the dream project of a small team of riders and developers, including members of the original crew behind Mad Skills Motocross and Mad Skills BMX. It’s a downhill mountain bike game built to capture what it really feels like to ride—the speed, the flow, and the satisfaction of control—paired with the obsessive pursuit of the perfect run. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Cranked Different <\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun-First Design<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is guided by a single question: does it make the game more fun? We're going back to old-school game design where our priority is the player experience. No microtransactions. No exploitative hooks.  Just pure MTB fun. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/e3afd90c59b2fc852cb993a639fb1dce.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/e3afd90c59b2fc852cb993a639fb1dce.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/e3afd90c59b2fc852cb993a639fb1dce.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Responsive Control<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “free-whip” system gives you full command of bike handling and style, with no canned animations getting in the way. Cranked has a heavy focus on technical riding, line choice, and capturing the essence of real-world trails. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/cac15661d55b504f7b5c941077e19057.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/cac15661d55b504f7b5c941077e19057.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/cac15661d55b504f7b5c941077e19057.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Racing Competition<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself against players worldwide on constantly updated leaderboards, with instant restarts that fuel mastery and the hunt for that perfect run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/0e78d650b5b0c86e6fb46c6f6a6822b6.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/0e78d650b5b0c86e6fb46c6f6a6822b6.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/0e78d650b5b0c86e6fb46c6f6a6822b6.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-Mountain Freedom<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast landscape of trails, hidden paths, shortcuts, and easter eggs at your own pace.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/900838e9d2dc6c6e60137aa46f8fd158.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/900838e9d2dc6c6e60137aa46f8fd158.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/900838e9d2dc6c6e60137aa46f8fd158.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modding as a Pillar<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding isn’t an extra feature; it’s a non-negotiable pillar of Cranked’s design.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/3bfda8f5e37e8e054ede1249172c557f.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/3bfda8f5e37e8e054ede1249172c557f.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/3bfda8f5e37e8e054ede1249172c557f.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cranked is the dream project of a small team of riders and developers, including members of the original crew behind Mad Skills Motocross and Mad Skills BMX. It’s a downhill mountain bike game built to capture what it really feels like to ride—the speed, the flow, and the satisfaction of control—paired with the obsessive pursuit of the perfect run. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What Makes Cranked Different <\/h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fun-First Design<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every choice is guided by a single question: does it make the game more fun? We're going back to old-school game design where our priority is the player experience. No microtransactions. No exploitative hooks.  Just pure MTB fun. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/e3afd90c59b2fc852cb993a639fb1dce.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/e3afd90c59b2fc852cb993a639fb1dce.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/e3afd90c59b2fc852cb993a639fb1dce.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Responsive Control<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The “free-whip” system gives you full command of bike handling and style, with no canned animations getting in the way. Cranked has a heavy focus on technical riding, line choice, and capturing the essence of real-world trails. <\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/cac15661d55b504f7b5c941077e19057.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/cac15661d55b504f7b5c941077e19057.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/cac15661d55b504f7b5c941077e19057.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Global Racing Competition<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Push yourself against players worldwide on constantly updated leaderboards, with instant restarts that fuel mastery and the hunt for that perfect run.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/0e78d650b5b0c86e6fb46c6f6a6822b6.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/0e78d650b5b0c86e6fb46c6f6a6822b6.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/0e78d650b5b0c86e6fb46c6f6a6822b6.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-Mountain Freedom<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a vast landscape of trails, hidden paths, shortcuts, and easter eggs at your own pace.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/900838e9d2dc6c6e60137aa46f8fd158.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/900838e9d2dc6c6e60137aa46f8fd158.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/900838e9d2dc6c6e60137aa46f8fd158.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span>  <\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modding as a Pillar<\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modding isn’t an extra feature; it’s a non-negotiable pillar of Cranked’s design.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/3bfda8f5e37e8e054ede1249172c557f.poster.avif?t=1792863088\" width=616 height=206 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/3bfda8f5e37e8e054ede1249172c557f.webm?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/extras\/3bfda8f5e37e8e054ede1249172c557f.mp4?t=1792863088\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span> <\/p>","short_description":"Explore, race, and freeride in Cranked and experience the raw thrill of downhill mountain biking. It’s fast, responsive, and grounded -- we're chasing what it really feels like to ride. Easy to pick up, impossible to put down, and packed with virtually endless skill depth.","supported_languages":"English","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/cffc89f44135dab0aa8a68c0932af5069756ad26\/header.jpg?t=1792863088","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/49ada625bfc88ca5abf4ae6b56af7dcda89b1516\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1792863088","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3989790\/49ada625bfc88ca5abf4ae6b56af7dcda89b1516\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1792863088","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600 (6 cores)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 4 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 1660 Super \/ RTX 2060 \/ Radeon RX 5600 XT \/ Intel Arc A580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-13400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 7600 (8+ cores)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 8 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce RTX 3060 12 GB \/ RTX 4060 \/ Radeon RX 6650 XT \/ Intel Arc B580<br><\/li><li><strong>DirectX:<\/strong> Version 11<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> OS X 10.6 or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M1<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M1<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> OS X 10.6 or higher<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Apple M3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 32 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> Apple M3<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"},"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> SteamOS, Ubuntu 22.04, Ubuntu 24.04<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-10400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 3600 (6 cores)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 16 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce GTX 1660 Super \/ RTX 2060 \/ Radeon RX 5600 XT \/ Intel Arc A580<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> SteamOS, Ubuntu 22.04, Ubuntu 24.04<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i5-13400 \/ AMD Ryzen 5 7600 (8+ cores)<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 32 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> GeForce RTX 3060 12 GB \/ RTX 4060 \/ Radeon RX 6650 XT \/ Intel Arc B580<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 8 GB available space<\/li><\/ul>"}}}}